{
  "format": "zylab.notebook.v1",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "统计学：正态分布与中心极限定理",
    "description": "正态分布 PDF/CDF、中心极限定理与最小二乘线性回归，含公式推导与曲线对比。",
    "created": "2026-09-10T14:56:50",
    "modified": "2026-09-10T14:56:50"
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "d2be4115f0124b9fb978f65fb2820097",
      "source": "# 正态分布概率密度函数（PDF）\n# f(x; μ, σ) = 1/(σ√(2π)) · exp(-(x-μ)²/(2σ²))\n# 固定 μ=0，σ 越大曲线越扁平、越矮（总面积恒为 1）\ndef normal_pdf(x, mu=0.0, sigma=1.0):\n    return 1.0 / (sigma * sqrt(2 * pi)) * exp(-((x - mu) ** 2) / (2 * sigma ** 2))\n\nx = linspace(-6, 6, 400)\nplot(x, normal_pdf(x, 0, 0.5), title=\"正态分布概率密度函数 f(x; 0, σ)\", xlabel=\"x\", ylabel=\"概率密度\", label=\"σ=0.5\")\nplot(x, normal_pdf(x, 0, 1.0), label=\"σ=1.0\")\nplot(x, normal_pdf(x, 0, 2.0), label=\"σ=2.0\")\n",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "outputs": [
